# What must never reach a build context.
#
# Beyond keeping the image small, this is a security boundary: anything listed
# here would otherwise be copied into a layer, and a layer is readable by
# anyone who can pull the image.

.env
.env.*
!.env.production.example
backups/
*.sql
*.sql.gz
shopify-sku-plan.csv
shopify-sku-rollback.json

.git
.github
node_modules
.next
.next-build
data/uploads

# Tests and docs do not run in production and only slow the build.
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
docs/
*.md
!README.md
